&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of culture and our people.&amp;nbsp; It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other.&amp;nbsp; In this role, it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by leading collectively to inspire transformational creativity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by balancing people and client experiences by cultivating trust&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead with &lt;strong&gt;optimism&lt;/strong&gt; by championing growth, learning and development to mobilize the enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ideal candidate will have a strong background in digital media operations for planning and execution, proven leadership experience and the ability to collaborate across markets, platforms, internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in biddable media operations and execution within a large-scale organisation or agency environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership experience in managing teams and driving digital transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in data-driven marketing and the integration of 1PD data sets into digital platforms and digital audience targeting technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with brand safety and verification platform partners, their commercial model and the impact on to media platform decisioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of channel maturity models, test-and-learn and incrementality frameworks and digital media best practises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with the ability to translate insights into strategic action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience working with the biddable platforms themselves towards gaining HME a competitive advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and familiarity with Ad Operations processes to ensure best practise processes are in place for digital media execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
